# Netlify serves this build as static files, so a route that only exists inside
# the router is a 404 on a cold load — /companies is linked from the front page
# and was returning one. Hand every unmatched path to the app and let the router
# decide, with a 200 rather than a redirect so the URL the visitor typed is the
# URL they keep.
#
# Safe as a catch-all because nothing else is served from this origin: the API
# runs elsewhere and the client is origin-relative only in development, where
# Vite proxies /api itself.
/*  /index.html  200
